# Package Installation

This is a personal project. Install new packages directly from the public npm registry:

```bash
npm install <package-name>
```

- Do NOT use private registries, scoped registries, or `.npmrc` overrides
- Use the default public npm registry (`https://registry.npmjs.org/`)
- Always install the latest version unless a specific version is required
